msgstr "Nicht stören ist an"

msgctxt "#30224"
msgid "Log: %s"
msgstr "Log: %s"

msgctxt "#30230"
msgid "Title size"
msgstr "Titelgröße"

msgctxt "#30231"
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Normal"

msgctxt "#30232"
msgid "Doorbell chime"
msgstr "Türklingelton"

msgctxt "#30233"
msgid "Plays a chime when a camera appears (follows Kodi's volume)."
msgstr "Spielt einen Gong, wenn eine Kamera erscheint (folgt der Kodi-Lautstärke)."

msgctxt "#30234"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Aus"

msgctxt "#30235"
msgid "Doorbell and alarm"
msgstr "Türklingel und Alarm"

msgctxt "#30236"
msgid "Every request"
msgstr "Jede Anfrage"

msgctxt "#30237"
msgid "Frigate address (for clips)"
msgstr "Frigate-Adresse (für Clips)"

msgctxt "#30238"
msgid "e.g. http://192.168.1.10:5000 - lets you replay Frigate clips from the event list."
msgstr "z. B. http://192.168.1.10:5000 - damit lassen sich Frigate-Clips aus der Ereignisliste abspielen."

msgctxt "#30239"
msgid "Camera control (PTZ) key"
msgstr "Taste für Kamerasteuerung (PTZ)"

msgctxt "#30240"
msgid "On cameras with PTZ this key toggles camera control (MENU works too)."
msgstr "Bei Kameras mit PTZ schaltet diese Taste die Steuerung (MENÜ geht auch)."

msgctxt "#30241"
msgid "RED"
msgstr "ROT"

msgctxt "#30242"
msgid "GREEN"
msgstr "GRÜN"

msgctxt "#30243"
msgid "YELLOW"
msgstr "GELB"

msgctxt "#30244"
msgid "BLUE"
msgstr "BLAU"

msgctxt "#30245"
msgid "Colour keys to Home Assistant"
msgstr "Farbtasten an Home Assistant"

msgctxt "#30246"
msgid "While a camera is shown the colour keys trigger a Home Assistant event (e.g. open the door)."
msgstr "Während eine Kamera angezeigt wird, lösen die Farbtasten ein Home-Assistant-Ereignis aus (z. B. Tür öffnen)."

msgctxt "#30247"
msgid "Log level"
msgstr "Log-Stufe"

msgctxt "#30248"
msgid "camalert.log in the add-on data folder (2 x 1 MB), besides kodi.log. Passwords are never logged."
msgstr "camalert.log im Add-on-Datenordner (2 x 1 MB), neben kodi.log. Passwörter werden nie protokolliert."

msgctxt "#30249"
msgid "Errors only"
msgstr "Nur Fehler"

msgctxt "#30250"
msgid "Verbose"
msgstr "Ausführlich"

msgctxt "#30251"
msgid "Remote syslog (host:port)"
msgstr "Entferntes Syslog (Host:Port)"

msgctxt "#30252"
msgid "Optional, e.g. 192.168.1.10:514 (UDP). Empty = off."
msgstr "Optional, z. B. 192.168.1.10:514 (UDP). Leer = aus."

msgctxt "#30253"
msgid "Home Assistant webhook"
msgstr "Home-Assistant-Webhook"

msgctxt "#30254"
msgid "%s - camera not reachable"
msgstr "%s - Kamera nicht erreichbar"

msgctxt "#30255"
msgid "Cooldown per camera"
msgstr "Wartezeit pro Kamera"

msgctxt "#30256"
msgid "Seconds per camera, e.g. *=30|garden=120 (* = all). An open window is still extended; alarm always passes."
msgstr "Sekunden pro Kamera, z. B. *=30|garten=120 (* = alle). Ein offenes Fenster wird verlängert; Alarm kommt immer durch."

msgctxt "#30257"
msgid "Live view substreams"
msgstr "Substreams für die Live-Ansicht"

msgctxt "#30258"
msgid "For a camera this Kodi cannot play smoothly (H.265 / 4K): front_door=front_door_sub|... (go2rtc stream names)."
msgstr "Für eine Kamera, die dieses Kodi nicht flüssig abspielt (H.265 / 4K): tuer=tuer_sub|... (go2rtc-Streamnamen)."

msgctxt "#30259"
msgid "Frigate objects"
msgstr "Frigate-Objekte"

msgctxt "#30260"
msgid "Frigate priority"
msgstr "Frigate-Priorität"

msgctxt "#30261"
msgid "Foscam priority"
msgstr "Foscam-Priorität"

msgctxt "#30262"
msgid "UniFi Protect events"
msgstr "UniFi-Protect-Ereignisse"

msgctxt "#30263"
msgid "Asks the UniFi Protect consoles in devices.conf for events (doorbell, person, vehicle, ...)."
msgstr "Fragt die UniFi-Protect-Konsolen in devices.conf nach Ereignissen (Türklingel, Person, Fahrzeug, ...)."

msgctxt "#30264"
msgid "UniFi Protect event types"
msgstr "UniFi-Protect-Ereignistypen"

msgctxt "#30265"
msgid "Comma separated: ring, person, vehicle, animal, package, motion."
msgstr "Durch Komma getrennt: ring, person, vehicle, animal, package, motion."

msgctxt "#30266"
msgid "UniFi Protect camera names"
msgstr "UniFi-Protect-Kameranamen"

msgctxt "#30267"
msgid "Only if the names differ from go2rtc: protect=go2rtc|other=other_stream"
msgstr "Nur wenn die Namen von go2rtc abweichen: protect=go2rtc|other=other_stream"

msgctxt "#30268"
msgid "UniFi Protect priority"
msgstr "UniFi-Protect-Priorität"

msgctxt "#30269"
msgid "A doorbell ring always gets at least the priority High."
msgstr "Ein Klingeln bekommt immer mindestens die Priorität Hoch."

msgctxt "#30270"
msgid "Log only"
msgstr "Nur protokollieren"

msgctxt "#30271"
msgid "Per event type"
msgstr "Pro Ereignistyp"

msgctxt "#30272"
msgid "Optional: type=priority/mode/camera, e.g. ring=alarm/live|motion=normal/log"
msgstr "Optional: type=priority/mode/camera, z. B. ring=alarm/live|motion=normal/log"

msgctxt "#30273"
msgid "Per camera"
msgstr "Pro Kamera"

msgctxt "#30274"
msgid "Optional, wins over the event type: camera=priority/mode/seconds, e.g. front_door=high/photo/30|driveway=normal/log"
msgstr "Optional, hat Vorrang vor dem Ereignistyp: camera=priority/mode/seconds, z. B. front_door=high/photo/30|driveway=normal/log"

msgctxt "#30275"
msgid "Change camera password (default)"
